        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddii nin isha addoonkiisa ama isha addoontiisa wax ku dhufto, oo ka rido, de markaas waa inuu iska sii daayaa isagoo xor ah, ishiisa aawadeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.26",
